{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Reject operation dispatch once a plugin fatal is stored.** This wrapper runs without first checking the fatal signal, and its same-thread branch deliberately does not rethrow. A later at-least-once `stepAsync` can consequently execute despite its START being discarded; with a direct executor, code after the failing call also runs. Check the signal before dispatch/running and rethrow it after inline execution; test both cases.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75uV1p","finding_digest":"4a59c5ffbcdb4835fc2b97b378f4361aad266e47803afa016ccedc3fb21a5955","finding_id":"arf_v1_jjm4l7543nedl7bls6zxr5bwdk","finding_key":"sdk/operation/basedurableoperation::runuserhandler::reported-fatal-operation-dispatch","identity_key":"sdk/operation/basedurableoperation::runuserhandler::reported-fatal-operation-dispatch","line":336,"observation_digest":"07d16c822ccd6176e7d8d504a79a77f8fa328a15198d0fccb06507be061f6566","observation_id":"aro_v1_a7iwzarmzvqxnz6y2uckpgtx7d","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/BaseDurableOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-05T22:49:55Z","review_id":"arr_v1_kfsnri6wu5y4d2bfhsye4jqsyn","reviewed_base_sha":"6045c38025275782197b771642129532058b8ccb","reviewed_head_sha":"189189e3465c03d341333907ed55587b989c9eb4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":330,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_gfxobqloumuj62mvmqufoy5xkv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T22:49:55Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
